x86_64-linux  the implicit constructors and destructors, not the cast: cxx1 emits _ZN4BaseC1Ev, _ZN6DeeperC1Ev, _ZN6DeeperD1Ev, _ZN7DerivedC1Ev and _ZN7DerivedD1Ev as ordinary definitions where clang emits them linkonce_odr in a comdat, which the collector does not see. Older than this case and not about dynamic_cast - the same difference dynamic-cast.nonames records. arm64-darwin and x86_64-windows agree on every name, which is what says the cast itself emits nothing unexpected: on Itanium it emits no symbol at all, and on Microsoft only the __RTCastToVoid import.
